        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ದತ್ತು ತೆಗೆದುಕೊ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದತ್ತು ತೆಗೆದುಕೊ — dattu tegeduko — \"to adopt\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ದಂಪತಿ ಒಂದು ಹೆಣ್ಣು ಮಗುವನ್ನು ದತ್ತು ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡರು. ā dampati ondu heṇṇu maguvannu dattu tegedukoṇḍaru. That couple adopted a baby girl."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ದತ್ತು ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡೆ, dattu tegedukoṇḍe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದತ್ತು is adoption, from Sanskrit ದತ್ತ, given; ದತ್ತು ಕೊಡು, to give a child in adoption."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದತ್ತು ತೆಗೆದುಕೊ (dattu tegeduko) joins dattu, \"adoption\", from Sanskrit datta, \"given\" (CDIAL 6140), and the native ತೆಗೆದುಕೊ, \"to take\": to take a child given to you."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
