              "text": "ಆ ಕಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಮಲತಾಯಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವಳು. ā katheyalli malatāyi tumbā oḷḷeyavaḷu. In that story the stepmother is very kind."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಲ- marks a step-relation: ಮಲತಮ್ಮ, a younger half-brother."
            }
          ]
        },
